# POWDER 118 Exclusions

# 1. Executables (support tools & game binaries)
*.exe

# 2. Generated Graphics Pipeline (rebuilt by gfx/rebuild.sh)
gfx/all_bitmaps.cpp
gfx/all_bitmaps.h

# 3. Visual Studio Caches & Per-User Files (any depth)
.vs/
*.user
*.suo

# 4. Visual Studio Migration & Upgrade Artifacts (strictly scoped to port/windows)
port/windows/Backup/
port/windows/UpgradeLog*
port/windows/_UpgradeReport_Files/